      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. It's definitely clear. \n\nOne thing though—I'm looking at the dashboard for the drill prep, and because the score for that last one was so low, it's sitting at the very bottom of the priority queue. I know I said the scoring is a bad metric, but if the score is too low, the drill coordinators won't even see it until tomorrow, and we need to finalize this today.\n\nCan you expand this a bit? I need more detail on the specific coordination steps between Fire and EMS, and maybe add a bit more \"weight\" to the instructions so it gets flagged as a high-priority item by the system? Again, please don't just list the keywords over and over, but make it feel more substantial and prominent so it doesn't get lost in the pile.",
